      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "The International Classification of Diseases, 10th Edition (ICD-10) does not have a specific code for BRASH (Bradycardia, Renal Failure, Atrioventricular Blockade, Shock, and Hyperkalemia) syndrome."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "However, the following ICD-10 codes may be used to describe the individual components of BRASH syndrome:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Bradycardia: I45.1 (Sinus bradycardia)"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Renal failure: N19 (Unspecified kidney failure)"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Atrioventricular blockade: I46 (Second-degree atrioventricular block)"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Shock: R57 (Hypovolemic shock)"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Hyperkalemia: E83.1 (Hyperkalemia)",
            "reference_indexes": [
              0,
              1,
              2,
              3,
              4,
              5,
              6
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "It is important to note that BRASH syndrome is a rare and complex condition, and the specific ICD-10 codes used may vary depending on the underlying cause and clinical presentation.",
        "reference_indexes": [
          7,
          8,
          9
        ]
      }
